<title>UK: Four killed in tanker fire off Iran.</title>
<headline>Four killed in tanker fire off Iran.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Filipino crew members were killed in an explosion aboard the 11,879 dwt tanker Freja Nordic off Iran, an official of the ship's Danish managers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The vessel's cargo of 8,000-9,000 tonnes of refined oil products had not caught fire in the engine room explosion on Wednesday night, added the official of D/S Progress in Copenhagen.</p>
<p>The Bahamian-flagged ship was now anchored off the port of Bandar Abbas and an investigation would be carried out, he said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +454 171 542 8085</p>
</text>
